# The paper's pinned corpora — the MonitoringBench evaded-every-monitor split and the
# swe-benign-4000 draw. Large, and the parquet path is part of a flow-store cell's key, so they
# ride in LFS rather than being regenerated per checkout. The swe-chat session corpus carries
# usernames in paths: it is here only because this repo is private, and must not be mirrored.
src/auto_mode_eval/paper_results/data/*.parquet filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
